## Rule Referencing Syntax

- Reference rules using the syntax `@rule-name.mdc`
- Use internal links within rules: `[rule-name](mdc:.cursor/rules/rule-name.mdc)`
- Don't repeat guidance that exists in other rule files - reference instead
- Implement clear cross-referencing standards
- Maintain dependency documentation

## File Naming Conventions

Follow cFish.io standard format:
`ucf-[department].[function]-[description]-[date].[extension]`

Function codes:
1. Documentation
2. Configuration
3. Tools
4. Scripts/Development
5. Testing
6. Automation
7. Infrastructure
8. Integration
9. Miscellaneous

Example: `ucf-u7.3-directory-visual-order-20250506.ps1`

